>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/diani-beach.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Off the beaten path · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Kitesurfing in Diani</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>3 days · 2 nights</b></span>
        <span>Diani · Galu Beach</span>
        <span>Resident rates available</span>
        <span>from <b>$980</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Kitesurfing%20in%20Diani" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off beat escapes</a> / Kitesurfing in Diani</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Catch the wind on one of the world's loveliest kite spots. During kite season the steady trade winds sweep the wide, flat sands of Galu Beach in Diani, perfect for first lessons or improving your game, and the warm shallow water makes learning a joy.</p>
        <p>A high energy weekend for those already on the coast or in Nairobi, with patient certified instructors and barefoot beach evenings. Total beginners welcome.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your escape</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Diani</h3><p>A short flight to Ukunda, then to your laid back lodge on Galu Beach. Settle in, walk the sand and watch the kites colour the sky at sunset.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Galu Beach lodge · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>On the water</h3><p>Your kitesurf lessons with an IKO certified instructor, kite control, body dragging and your first water starts in the warm lagoon. An afternoon session, then sundowners and tired, happy muscles.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Galu Beach lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>One more session &amp; fly home</h3><p>A final morning on the kite, or a swim and a long breakfast for the gentler souls, then transfer to the airstrip for your flight home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Return flights to Diani &amp; transfers</li>
          <li>Two nights at a Galu Beach lodge</li>
          <li>Kitesurf lessons with a certified instructor</li>
          <li>All kite &amp; board equipment</li>
          <li>Breakfast daily &amp; meals as shown</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$980 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>resident rates available</strong>. Kite seasons run roughly December to March and June to September, when the winds are most reliable. Non kiters can join for the beach.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Ride the wind.</h2><p>Tell us your level and dates and we'll match you with the right instructor and stay.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Kitesurfing%20in%20Diani" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More escapes</p><h2 class="section__title">Other off beat escapes</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="tuna-fishing-lamu.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-lamu.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Big Game Fishing in Lamu</h3><p>3 days · The Majlis.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="balloon-mara.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Balloon over the Mara</h3><p>2 days · dawn flight.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="index.html#experiences"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/horse-safari.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All quick escapes</h3><p>Browse every off beat experience.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

